<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine paging firm sets 75 centavo dividend.</title>
<headline>Philippine paging firm sets 75 centavo dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paging company Easy Call Communication Philippines Inc's board on Tuesday approved a 75 centavo cash dividend.</p>
<p>The cash dividend, equivalent to 47,496,669 pesos, will be given to stockholders of record as of September 20 payable on October 11 this year.</p>
<p>-Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
